      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i guess it just feels heavy. like i've been doing this loop for years and nothing ever changes. nobody is waiting for me at the end of the route, and nobody would even notice if i just stopped midway. it's like there's no point to any of it, you know? just empty road and more empty road.",
