    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly i dont think there's any reason. even if i found someone, it would just be more noise, more things to keep up. it feels more like i'm just taking up space in a world that doesn't need me. if i just... stopped, it wouldn't be a tragedy, it would just be like a truck breaking down on the side of the road. just another thing that happened and then was gone.",
